      <p>The four foundations behind every event we deliver.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid four">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="photo-wrap"><img class="photo" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Event Strategy" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="card-body">
        <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v18M12 3l7 3-7 3"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Event Strategy</h3>
        <p class="teaser">Define goals, audiences and experiences that create impact.</p>
        <div class="detail"><ul>
          <li>Vision workshops</li>
          <li>Audience mapping</li>
          <li>Success metrics</li>
        </ul></div>
        <div class="hint">Hover for details</div>
        <button class="book-btn" onclick="bookCall('Event Strategy')">Book a call</button>
      </div></div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="photo-wrap"><img class="photo" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Event Planning" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="card-body">
        <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="17" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18M8 2v4M16 2v4"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Event Planning</h3>
        <p class="teaser">Full-service planning for a seamless, impactful experience.</p>
        <div class="detail"><ul>
          <li>End-to-end logistics</li>
          <li>Vendor coordination</li>
          <li>Budget oversight</li>
        </ul></div>
