      </div></div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="photo-wrap"><img class="photo" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Marketing" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="card-body">
        <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 11l14-7v16L3 13z"/><path d="M8 12v6l3 1"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Marketing</h3>
        <p class="teaser">We promote your event and amplify your message.</p>
        <div class="detail"><ul>
          <li>Multi-channel promotion</li>
