      </div></div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="photo-wrap"><img class="photo" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="On-Site Management" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="card-body">
        <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 21V9l9-6 9 6v12M9 21v-6h6v6"/></svg></div>
        <h3>On-Site Management</h3>
        <p class="teaser">Professional event-day coordination so everything runs flawlessly.</p>
        <div class="detail"><ul>
          <li>Day-of direction</li>
          <li>Team management</li>
          <li>Live troubleshooting</li>
        </ul></div>
        <div class="hint">Hover for details</div>
        <button class="book-btn" onclick="bookCall('On-Site Management')">Book a call</button>
