      <p>The kinds of gatherings we design and deliver for mission-driven organizations.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid four">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="photo-wrap"><img class="photo" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Galas &amp; Fundraisers" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="card-body">
        <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 8a4 4 0 0 0-7-2.6A4 4 0 0 0 6 8c0 4 6 8 7 9 1-1 7-5 7-9z"/></svg></div>
